          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "телевизор (televízor) is an international coinage: Greek tēle, \"far\", with -визор, from Latin vīsor, \"one who sees\", from vidēre, \"to see\": a far-seer."
            }
